[00:15.42] All eyes look up to me
[00:21.62] High above the filthy streets
[00:27.73] Heed no bone when it calls
[00:34.01] Watch me fly and die, watch me fall
[00:40.27] I'm the boy they can't ignore
[00:42.92] For the first time in my life I'm sure
[00:46.53] All the love sent up high to pledge
[00:51.53] Won't reach the ledge
[00:55.49] 
[00:58.98] Wind blows cold from the west
[01:04.65] I smell coffee, I smell donuts for the press
[01:11.30] A girl that I knew once years ago
[01:17.44] Is trying me to reach on the phone
[01:22.39] I'm the boy she can't ignore
[01:25.07] For the first time in my life I'm sure
[01:28.58] All the love sent up high to pledge
[01:33.38] I'm the boy she can't ignore
[01:35.90] For the first time in my life I'm sure
[01:39.53] All the love sent up high to pledge
[01:45.11] 
[02:23.47] Freeze me inside all is still
[02:29.47] Policeman reaches from the sill
[02:35.76] Watch him try, watch him try his best
[02:41.81] There'll be no helping to his journey
[02:48.24] I'm the boy they couldn't ignore
[02:50.92] For the first time in my life I'm sure
[02:54.57] I'm the boy they couldn't ignore
[02:57.21] For the first time in my life I'm sure
[03:00.65] I'm the boy for the last time in my life
[03:06.88] All the love that they pledge
[03:09.53] For the last time will not reach the ledge
[04:13.57] 